{"gene1":{"symbol":"PAX3","uniprot":"P23760","is_essential":false,"chromosome":{"chromosome":"2","start":"222199887","end":"222298998","strand":"-1"},"description":{"name":"Paired box protein Pax-3","function":"Transcription factor that may regulate cell proliferation, migration and apoptosis. Involved in neural development and myogenesis. Transcriptional activator of MITF, acting synergistically with SOX10 (PubMed:21965087)"},"known_drugs":[]},"gene2":{"symbol":"PAX5","uniprot":"Q02548","is_essential":false,"chromosome":{"chromosome":"9","start":"36833269","end":"37034268","strand":"-1"},"description":{"name":"Paired box protein Pax-5","function":"Transcription factor that plays an essential role in commitment of lymphoid progenitors to the B-lymphocyte lineage (PubMed:10811620, PubMed:27181361). Fulfills a dual role by repressing B-lineage inappropriate genes and simultaneously activating B-lineage-specific genes (PubMed:10811620, PubMed:27181361). In turn, regulates cell adhesion and migration, induces V(H)-to-D(H)J(H) recombination, facilitates pre-B-cell receptor signaling and promotes development to the mature B-cell stage (PubMed:32612238). Repression of the cohesin-release factor WAPL causes global changes of the chromosomal architecture in pro-B cells to facilitate the generation of a diverse antibody repertoire (PubMed:32612238)"},"known_drugs":[]},"pair":{"wgd":false,"family_size":51,"closest":false,"same_chr":false,"interact_bioplex":false,"n_shared_ppi":2,"ppi_network":{"shared":[{"id":"1616","symbol":null,"display":"1616"},{"id":"6908","symbol":"TBP","display":"TBP (6908)"}],"unique_gene1":[{"id":"10112","symbol":"KIF20A","display":"KIF20A (10112)"},{"id":"10155","symbol":"TRIM28","display":"TRIM28 (10155)"},{"id":"10516","symbol":"FBLN5","display":"FBLN5 (10516)"},{"id":"10927","symbol":"SPIN1","display":"SPIN1 (10927)"},{"id":"112399","symbol":"EGLN3","display":"EGLN3 (112399)"},{"id":"1277","symbol":"COL1A1","display":"COL1A1 (1277)"},{"id":"1278","